{
    "reasoner_response": "Begin by acknowledging the customer's vehicle: "I can see you have a 2022 FORD EXPLORER XLT on file." Then, answer their coverage question by paraphrasing the contract terms: "Based on your contract, the DriverPlus Services covered include oil changes, oil filter changes, lubrication of front suspension, steering linkage, and ball joints where applicable, and multipoint inspections. If you have the Preferred Plus plan, tire rotation is also included at each service visit. Please keep in mind that the actual coverage available to you will depend on your specific claim's authorization." Ask if they have a specific component or service in mind, or if they would like more details about their contract.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
